WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.833
♪Oh no ♪

00:00:01.833 --> 00:00:04.060
- I don't know somebody on the
internet told me to do that.

00:00:04.060 --> 00:00:05.740
- [Vaccinator] Okay, and then
do you want to count down,

00:00:05.740 --> 00:00:06.820
or do you want me to distract you?

00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:07.653
- Just do it.

00:00:07.653 --> 00:00:09.693
- [Vaccinator] Okay.

00:00:09.693 --> 00:00:10.710
- That's it?

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:11.543
- [Vaccinator] Yeah.

00:00:11.543 --> 00:00:13.230
- We're about 15 hours post vaccine,

00:00:13.230 --> 00:00:16.650
and my side effects, other
than being beautiful,

00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:20.240
is lack of motivation, the
urge to want to watch TV,

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:22.840
binge eat everything.

00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:23.673
What's that?

00:00:23.673 --> 00:00:24.506
Oh, those aren't side effects,

00:00:24.506 --> 00:00:26.051
that's just me every day.

